- 如果黑方走 c2，Kxc2 吃兵，同时攻击 b3 的车。 - 如果黑方走 Rb2（同时威胁 c2 和
a2），Kxc3 反攻 b2 的车。车离开后，白车可以吃 a3 兵。 - 如果黑方走 Rb1，Kc2
攻车；黑方 Rb2+ 后再 Kxc3，局面同样可守。 } 42... c2+ 43. Kxc2 { [%emt 0:00:10]
[%think 422] [%out 597] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 2056] The check
comes from the black rook on b3 along the third rank; it is a discovered check,
since the pawn moved off c3. The pawn on c2 is about to promote, so it must be
dealt with right away. - **Kxc2** is legal. The rook on b3 does not cover c2,
and the a3 pawn only covers b2. Capturing removes the pawn and also attacks the
rook on b3. - Any other king move, such as Kd2 or Kc4, lets the pawn promote on
c1. That would lose. } 43... Rb2+ 44. Kc3 { [%emt 0:00:12] [%think 574]
[%out 669] [%in 2] [%cacheread 0] [%cachewrite 2082] 被将军，而 b2 上的车有 a3
